        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this superb three-bedroom, three-bathroom house to the rental market in the highly sought-after Belfry Square development, Citywest, Dublin 24.\nThis bright and well-presented house offers spacious and comfortable living accommodation throughout and is ideally located close to a host of local amenities. Residents can enjoy easy access to Citywest Shopping Centre, shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, parks and leisure facilities, with Saggart and Tallaght also within easy reach.\nThe property benefits from excellent transport links, including the Red Luas Line and Dublin Bus routes, while the N7 and M50 motorway network are easily accessible, making this an ideal location for commuters.\nInternal accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, bright and spacious living room, fully fitted kitchen, three generously sized bedrooms and three bathrooms. The property also benefits from a private rear garden and a garden shed which can be used as second living area.\nAVAILABLE NOW and viewing is highly advised.\nFeatures:\n<ul>\n <li>3 bedroom / 3 bathroom house</li>\n <li>Presented in excellent condition throughout</li>\n <li>Bright and spacious living accommodation</li>\n <li>Fully fitted kitchen</li>\n <li>Three generously sized bedrooms</li>\n <li>Three bathrooms</li>\n <li>Private rear garden</li>\n <li>Garden shed</li>\n <li>Close to Citywest Shopping Centre</li>\n <li>Excellent public transport links</li>\n <li>Easy access to N7 & M50 motorways</li>\n <li>A host of local amenities nearby</li>\n</ul>\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS EMAIL ENQUIRY ONLY/NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION AND WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE"
      },
